        <exclude body1="right_wrist_roll_link" body2="right_hand_link" />
        <!-- knee_link's shin mesh wraps close around the ankle_pitch_link joint housing (which has no collision geom of its own), so knee-ankle_roll is 2 bodies apart and not auto-excluded, same pattern as pelvis-hip_roll_link above. Confirmed near-constant false contact (627/626 sampled frames of a martial-arts clip) without this exclude, once collision geoms were switched from primitives to real link meshes. -->
